    "content": {
     "header": "A day in berc winter ",
     "subheader": "",
     "headerLayout": 0,
     "headerPosition": "",
     "headerLink": "",
     "type": "mask_list",
     "title": "A day in berc winter ",
     "text": "",
     "listitems": [
      {
       "uid": "180",
       "title": "07:30 – MORNING BEGINS CALM",
       "text": "<p>Before the first gondola rises from the valley, the way leads straight from eriro onto the slopes of the Ehrwalder Alm. Ski-in, ski-out. Untouched snow, empty runs - only the quiet glide of skis. First light settles on the peaks - pink drifting into blue. Nothing stands between the moment and now.&nbsp;</p>"
      },
      {
       "uid": "181",
       "title": "08:00 – FIRST LINES IN POWDER ",
       "text": "<p>Cold air clears the mind; every turn is placed with intent. The mountain reveals itself wide and quietly grand. The ski pass is part of the all-in service.&nbsp;</p>"
      },
      {
       "uid": "182",
       "title": "09:00 – WARMTH & NOURISHMENT ",
       "text": "<p>Back for a pause: hands begin to warm, the gaze comes to rest on the snow-covered wide. Fortifying delights made with regional produce are already set on the table - thick socks on the feet, a smile on the lips. The serene knowing: something has already been done for oneself. No spectators - only the self.&nbsp;</p>"
      },
      {
       "uid": "183",
       "title": "10:30 – THE MOUNTAIN IN ITS WINTER ROBE",
       "text": "<p>Step by step, accompanied by the white openness. The view expands - chamois leap from rock to rock, and a raven becomes a friendly companion. A snowshoe hike with our guide through the snow-covered mountain world sharpens the eye for life in <i>berc </i>winter.&nbsp;</p>"
      },
      {
       "uid": "193",
       "title": "13:30 – STOPPING IN & PAUSING",
       "text": "<p>Warming cuisine and the taste of the mountain. Wind and weather on the plate - the moods of the season transformed into nourishing dishes. A moment of reflection. A book, a board game, a steaming herbal tea, the gaze on the white landscape.</p>"
      },
      {
       "uid": "226",
       "title": "14:30 – FLOWING FREELY",
       "text": "<p>The body feels restored, yet there is one more place to be. Just a few steps away, the warm alpine meadow infinity pool awaits, its waterline level with the snow-covered expanse beyond. Steam rises into the crisp winter air, each breath becomes visible, snow falls softly, and the silence is almost tangible.</p>"
      },
      {
       "uid": "194",
       "title": "15:00 – HANtWERC & LETTING GO",
       "text": "<p>Pottery or working with wood and hands. Real material, imagination flowing into form; thoughts are allowed to pass. A meditative rhythm that grounds and gathers.&nbsp;</p>"
      },
      {
       "uid": "195",
       "title": "16:30 – WARMTH & RECOVERY",
       "text": "<p><i>ochi kema</i>: sauna, water, hay room and sound loungers. Heat sinks into the body while outside the evening glow ignites the snow-covered peaks in fiery colour. A natural spectacle that holds one spellbound.&nbsp;</p>"
      },
      {
       "uid": "196",
       "title": "19:00 – EVENING BY THE FIRE",
       "text": "<p>Dinner warms from within - created with care. Stories begin to form - sometimes spoken, often only thought. Like earlier times, when families sat together on winter evenings and let stories unfold.</p>"
      },
      {
       "uid": "197",
       "title": "21:00 – NIGHT ABOVE THE MOUNTAIN",
       "text": "<p>Outside, snow glitters in moonlight beneath a sky full of stars. Inside: calm, shelter, the soft crackle of the fire. A good glass of wine. The mountain keeps watch.&nbsp;</p>"
      }
     ]
    }
   },
